  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Targeted HIV Prevention, Testing and Treatment for Key Population and Mobile Communities in Southeast Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will continue to scale up HIV prevention, testing, and supported services to maintain treatment cohort, for migrants and mobility-impacted communities in Southeast Myanmar, with particular focus on increased testing services and linkage to National AIDS programme.</narrative>
  </description>
